   "data": {
    "text": "HERD MENTALITY\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 4, CC 33 to 41\n   1 Herd mentality\n   2 Who leads the herd\n   3 Dissenter\n   4 Group pressure\n   5 suite: A mob forms\n   6 suite: The lone voice\n   7 pair: When someone defies the group, the pressure rises\n   8 pair: When the herd grows, doubts go quiet\n   9 pairs: The group closes ranks"
